@startuml
title EIVAS System Architecture (Component View)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 200

actor "Epidemiological Form Filler" as Filler
actor "Epidemiological Analyst" as Analyst

package "Client Tier" {
  component "Front-end Pages" as FrontEnd
  component "Map/Geographic Visualization Capability" as MapVis
}

package "Application Tier" {
  component "Back-end API" as Backend
  component "Association Analysis Service" as AssocSvc
  component "Statistics Aggregator" as StatsAgg
  component "Data Quality Checker" as DataQC
  component "Rate Limiter" as RateLimiter
  component "Encryption/Privacy Filter" as PrivacyFilter
}

package "Algorithm Module" {
  component "Algorithm Module" as AlgoModule
  component "Risk & Flow Calculator" as RiskCalc
  component "Case Clustering Engine" as ClusterEng
  AlgoModule -[hidden]-> RiskCalc
  AlgoModule -[hidden]-> ClusterEng
}

database "Back-end Database" as DB

Filler --> FrontEnd
Analyst --> FrontEnd

FrontEnd --> PrivacyFilter : API requests\n(encrypt personal info queries)
PrivacyFilter --> RateLimiter : request flow control
RateLimiter --> Backend : allowed requests

Backend --> DB : read/write\ncases, itineraries, associations
Backend --> AssocSvc : query associated cases\n(spatial & temporal thresholds)
AssocSvc --> DB : read itinerary/location data

Backend --> AlgoModule : analysis requests\n(flow map, clustering)
AlgoModule --> RiskCalc
AlgoModule --> ClusterEng
RiskCalc --> DB : read case investigation data
ClusterEng --> DB : read case investigation data

Backend --> StatsAgg : compute\nheat map/temperature-humidity/age/occupation/transportation stats
StatsAgg --> DB : read aggregated data

FrontEnd --> MapVis : display\naddresses & itinerary paths

Backend --> DataQC : check data quality
DataQC --> Backend : errors/prompts or OK

Backend --> FrontEnd : lists, associations,\ncharts, errors

note right of FrontEnd
- Epidemiological reporting
- Case management (search/sort/filter)
- Individual case analysis
- Overall analysis & outbreak overview
end note

note right of DB
Stores: basic case info, disease-related info,
itinerary trajectory, imported-case info,
associated case entries, data quality state.
end note

note top of RateLimiter
Cools down frequent-query IPs (NFR-005)
end note

note top of PrivacyFilter
Ensures encryption for personal info queries (NFR-004)
end note

note right of RiskCalc
Generates regional flow maps (FR-012)
end note

note right of ClusterEng
Generates case clustering graphs (FR-013)
end note

@enduml